Changes:
 verify-iso-sig (2026.08.05) mx; urgency=medium
 .
   * Make --untrust-key durable against pubring.kbx auto-re-trust.
   * Rename GUI "Forget Selected" to "Untrust Selected"
   * Recognize a cleartext-signed per-ISO checksum (e.g. "<iso>.sha512.asc")
   * Register shared-mime-info types and icons for "*.sha256.asc"/
     "*.sha512.asc" and for "*.iso.sig", with "Open With" support.
